501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰二年恭上太皇太后尊号八首 其八","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"麟趾袅蹄，我宝斯刻。\n碝磩采致，载备斯册。\n眉寿万年，诒谋燕翼。\n于赫汤孙，克绵永福。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2692,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰二年恭上太皇太后尊号八首 其六","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"维寿伊何，圣德日新。\n维慈伊何，祐于后人。\n乃范斯金，乃镂斯珉。\n皇举玉趾，从于尧门。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2693,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰二年恭上太皇太后尊号八首 其三","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"荡荡天门，金铺玉户。\n采旄翠旌，流苏葆羽。\n千官影从，乃导乃辅。\n都人纵观，填道呼舞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2694,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其十三","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"宝坐既兴，凤舆戒行。\n奏解严办，归燕邃清。\n问安寿慈，奉赍宗祊。\n弥千万年，内助圣明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2695,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其十二","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"金石具举，典礼茂明。\n淑慎其止，遹观厥成。\n琼琚微动，凤辇翼行。\n仪光媲极，德迈嫔京。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2696,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其十一","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"妇荣于室，通籍禁中。\n班列有次，车服有容。\n佐我关雎，鹊巢之风。\n被之僮僮，曷不肃雍。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2697,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其十","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"服焕盛仪，班分华致。\n九嫔妇职，六寝内治。\n参差荇菜，求勤寤寐。\n烝然来思，相礼赞祭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2698,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其九","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"宝玺瑶册，既祗既承。\n绣裀藻席，载跻载升。\n柔仪肃穆，瑞命端凝。\n永膺多福，如川方增。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2699,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其八","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"日月临烛，乾坤覆持。\n明并二曜，德合两仪。\n光媲宸极，共恢化基。\n膺受茂典，亿载永宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2700,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其七","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"瑶殿清閟，玉墄坦夷。\n袆衣副珈，陟降不迟。\n宝册聿至，载肃载祗。\n礼仪昭备，福履永绥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2701,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其六","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"虹辉灿烂，云篆绸缪。\n绛节前导，瑞光上浮。\n瑶阶玉扉，既集长秋。\n钦承天宠，永荷帝休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2702,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其五","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"日薰椒屋，云霭璧门。\n有华瑞节，来自帝阍。\n统天惟乾，合德者坤。\n我龙受之，福禄永繁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2703,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其四","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"天临黼扆，云集弁缨。\n金石递奏，典礼备成。\n玉趾缓步，龙驾翼行。\n言旋北极，永燕西清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2704,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其三","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"瑶册玉宝，烂然瑞辉。\n旁翼绛节，上承紫微。\n璆鸣朝佩，徐出兽扉。\n登进坤极，益彰典徽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2705,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其二","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"端门晓辟，瑞气云凝。\n有俨良辅，踵武造廷。\n肃肃王命，是将是承。\n登册穆清，万岁永膺。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2706,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"嘉泰三年皇后册宝十三首 其一","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"茂建坤极，容典聿新。\n天命所赞，慈训是遵。\n肃涓谷旦，躬御紫宸。\n鸿禧累福，骈赉翕臻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2707,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁以后祀高禖六首 其六 送神用《理安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"礼奠蠲衷，祭仪竣事。\n丕拥灵休，蕃衍皇嗣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2708,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁以后祀高禖六首 其五 亚、终献用《文安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"赫赫高禖，万世所祀。\n其德不回，锡兹福祉。\n蕃衍椒聊，和平芣苢。\n传类降康，世济其美。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2709,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁以后祀高禖六首 其四 酌献用《祐安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"昭荐精衷，灵承端命。\n青帝顾怀，神禖储庆。\n祚以蕃昌，协于熙盛。\n螽斯众多，流于雅咏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2710,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁以后祀高禖六首 其三 奠玉币用《嘉安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"昔帝高辛，先禖肇祀。\n爰揆仲阳，式祈嘉祉。\n陈之牺牲，授以弓矢。\n敷祐皇宗，施于孙子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2711,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁以后祀高禖六首 其一 降神用《高安》。六变。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"容台讲礼，禖宫立祠。\n司分届后，带韣陈仪。\n嘉祥萃止，灵驭来思。\n皇支蕃衍，永固邦基。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2712,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁亲享明堂二首 其二 酌献用《德安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"英声迈古，德施在民。\n允秩宗祀，宾延上神。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2713,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁亲享明堂二首 其一 英宗奠币用《诚安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"于皇圣考，克配上帝。\n永言孝思，昭荐嘉币。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2714,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀武成王一首 初献升降用《同安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"武德洸洸，日靖四方。\n百王所祀，休有烈光。\n命官摄事，佩玉锵锵。\n思皇多祜，以惠无疆。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2715,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其十二 送神用《阜安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"神兮来下，享此苾芬。\n酌献雍雍，执事孔勤。\n神之还矣，忽乘飞云。\n遗我祺祥，物象忻忻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2716,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其十一 彻豆用《丰安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"曳我黼黻，履舄接武。\n锵我珩璜，降升圉圉。\n其将肆兮，既曰不侮。\n其终彻兮，恭钦惟主。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2717,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其十 亚、终献用《仪安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"折俎在笾，胾羹在豆。\n何以酌之，酒醴是侑。\n何以锡之，贻尔眉寿。\n何以格之，永尔康阜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2718,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其九 退文舞、迎武舞用《威安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"雍雍肃肃，建我采旄。\n舞以玉戚，不吴不敖。\n其将其肆，脾臄嘉肴。\n何以侑乐，钟鼓管箫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2719,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其八 饮福用《禔安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"载登坛阼，载酌尊彝。\n牲酒嘉旨，福禄纯熙。\n其福维何，万物咸宜。\n其禄维何，永承神禧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2720,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其七 太祖用《佑安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"光大含弘，坤元之力。\n海宇咸宁，烈祖之德。\n作配方坛，不僭不忒。\n子孙其承，毋替厥则。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2721,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其六 酌献用《和安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"猗嗟富媪，博厚含弘。\n发荣敷秀，动植兹丰。\n爰酌兹酒，肸蚃交通。\n众祥萃止，垂祜无穷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2722,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其五 司徒奉俎用《承安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"我修祀事，于何致诚。\n罔敢怠佚，视兹硕牲。\n纳烹荐俎，侑以和声。\n格哉休应，世济皇明。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2723,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其四 太祖用《肇安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"于皇烈祖，维帝所兴。\n光辉宗祀，如日之升。\n告灵作配，孝享烝烝。\n锡兹祉福，百世其承。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2724,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"熙宁祀皇地祇十二首 其三 奠币用《釐安》。","author":"郊庙朝会歌辞","text":"纯诚昭融，芳美嘉荐。\n肃将二精，以享以奠。\n休光四充，灵祇来燕。\n其祥伊何，永世锡羡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":2725,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]